# Public, build-time config — inlined into both server and client bundles by
# Vite. Nothing secret goes here (that's what `.dev.vars` / wrangler secrets
# are for on the Worker side).
#
# .env itself is gitignored — copy this file to .env and fill it in. There
# was previously no committed record of what value this needs at all.

# Staging: https://api.staging.landingpagebuild.com
# Production: not wired yet — see STATUS.md's Phase 4 entry.
PUBLIC_WORKER_API_URL=https://api.staging.landingpagebuild.com
